WEBVTT

00:01:25.746 --> 00:01:30.579
we often aren’t aware of, 
but touch every aspect of our lives.

00:01:30.621 --> 00:01:31.704
Look around your home.

00:01:31.954 --> 00:01:35.121
Refrigeration— 
along with other heating and cooling—

00:01:35.121 --> 00:01:38.454
makes up about 6% of total emissions.

00:01:38.913 --> 00:01:43.454
Agriculture, which produces our food,
accounts for 18%.

00:01:43.454 --> 00:01:47.079
Electricity is responsible for 27%.

00:01:47.538 --> 00:01:51.621
Walk outside, and the cars zipping past,
planes overhead,

00:01:51.621 --> 00:01:53.996
trains ferrying commuters to work—

00:01:53.996 --> 00:01:56.329
transportation, including shipping,

00:01:56.329 --> 00:02:00.579
contributes 16% 
of greenhouse gas emissions.